(:reading :do "all four short cards are far above the 799-token card on this model, and the 150-token card is not below the 450-token ones; with 9 to 15 valid trials per arm the four lab arms cannot be ranked, so the ASN row form shows no advantage and no disadvantage. The tasks differ between the asl rows and the lab rows except for 4, and the cards were written from failures on these tasks, so the gain is an upper bound")
